  "headline": "Two Information Channels, One Design Limit: An Information-Theoretic Framework for Generative AI in Synthetic Gene-Circuit Design",
  "description": "A theoretical framework for separating generative proposal uncertainty from context-dependent realization uncertainty in synthetic gene-circuit design. Numerical examples are analytical or synthetic and do not establish biological performance.",
